A NOTE ON WHY

  GitHub will show this repository as having no recognized license, because
  "all rights reserved" is not an OSI-approved one. That is deliberate. The
  code is here to be read and assessed, and the 446-document content corpus
  under content/ is the part that would be least appropriate to hand over for
  reuse.
